</style>

{% comment %} ═══ SECTION 4: Beliefs ═══ {% endcomment %}
<div class="ab-beliefs-section">
  <div class="ab-beliefs-inner">
    <h2 class="ab-beliefs-headline">
      Three things we<br>believe about<br>beauty.<br>
      <span class="ab-beliefs-headline-sub">Everything else<br>follows.</span>
    </h2>

    <div class="ab-beliefs-list">
      <div class="ab-belief-item">
        <div class="ab-belief-title">Regenerative science.<br>Not trend science.</div>
        <div class="ab-belief-desc">Longevity is the one true purpose of beauty. The science of how skin renews, repairs, and rebuilds is the only science worth building on.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="ab-belief-item">
        <div class="ab-belief-title">India is the future<br>of beauty.</div>
        <div class="ab-belief-desc">We are an Indian brand that holds itself to a global standard. More money spent on raw materials than on packaging. A limited portfolio built around one system, not a shelf of launches. No trend-chasing, no magic wand claims. The Indian consumer deserves world-class products made here, not world-class products imported and resold. We intend to prove it is possible.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="ab-belief-item">
        <div class="ab-belief-title">Difficult choices over<br>popular ones.</div>
        <div class="ab-belief-desc">We chose the 75 day protocol when 7 days would have been easier to sell. We publish what we put in the formula when opacity would have been easier to defend. We show quantitative clinical data when before/after photography would have been easier to produce. Every difficult choice is a decision about what kind of brand this is.</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<style>
  .ab-beliefs-section { background:#161616; width:100%; padding:100px 48px; display:flex; justify-content:center; }
  .ab-beliefs-inner { max-width:1600px; width:100%; display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:60px; }
  
  .ab-beliefs-headline { font-family:'Inter',sans-serif; font-size:clamp(40px, 6vw, 85px); font-weight:600; color:#fff; line-height:1.05; margin:0; letter-spacing:-0.03em; }
  .ab-beliefs-headline-sub { font-style:italic; font-weight:600; color:rgba(255,255,255,0.6); display:block; }
  
  .ab-beliefs-list { display:flex; flex-direction:column; border-top:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.15); margin-top:20px; }
  .ab-belief-item { display:flex; padding:40px 0; border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.15); gap:40px; }
  
  .ab-belief-title { flex:0 0 25%; font-family:'Inter',sans-serif; font-size:clamp(16px, 1.4vw, 20px); color:#fff; font-weight:600; line-height:1.4; }
  .ab-belief-desc { flex:1; font-family:'Inter',sans-serif; font-size:clamp(14px, 1vw, 15px); color:rgba(255,255,255,0.7); font-weight:400; line-height:1.8; }
  
  @media(max-width:768px) {
    .ab-beliefs-section { padding:60px 20px; }
    .ab-beliefs-inner { gap:40px; }
    .ab-belief-item { flex-direction:column; gap:16px; padding:32px 0; }
    .ab-belief-title { flex:none; }
  }
</style>

{% comment %} ═══ SECTION 5: Profiles ═══ {% endcomment %}
<div class="ab-profiles-section">
  <!-- Profile 1 -->
  <div class="ab-profile-row">
    <div class="ab-profile-image">
      <!-- Replace src with your image URL after uploading to Shopify -->
      <img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0533/2089/files/placeholder-images-image_large.png" alt="Nishit Ratthe" loading="lazy">
    </div>
    <div class="ab-profile-text">
      <h3 class="ab-profile-name">Nishit<br><span class="ab-profile-lastname">Ratthe</span></h3>
      <p class="ab-profile-quote">I love beauty too much to watch it swim in mediocrity.</p>
      <p class="ab-profile-body">Fourteen years at L'Oréal and Marico, spent falling deeply in love with what beauty could actually do. Nishit has always believed the category holds something close to magic: real science, world-class ingredients, the genuine power to change how someone feels in their own skin. His whole career has been about chasing that potential rather than the shortcut. Beauty taught him more about life than anything else, and he wanted to give that back in a product that earns its claims. For him, longevity was never a trend to ride. It is the most honest expression of what skincare is for: not fixing you, but supporting what your skin can already become, kept up long enough to last.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Profile 2 -->
  <div class="ab-profile-row ab-profile-row-reverse">
    <div class="ab-profile-image">
      <!-- Replace src with your image URL after uploading to Shopify -->
      <img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0533/2089/files/placeholder-images-image_large.png" alt="Pratha Bhatia" loading="lazy">
    </div>
    <div class="ab-profile-text">
      <h3 class="ab-profile-name">Pratha<br><span class="ab-profile-lastname">Bhatia</span></h3>
      <p class="ab-profile-quote">I know what it costs to not feel like yourself. And I know a daily habit can give it back.</p>
      <p class="ab-profile-body">Parsons-trained. Rejected an offer from The MET, left NYC to come back and build in India. Pratha has always seen creation as a place of possibility, where something made well can change how a person carries themselves. She believes in the value of looking good, and in the craft of making things genuinely beautiful, not because surface is everything, but because it isn't nothing. Her real subject is confidence. Having spent years on the wrong side of it herself, she understands that confidence is rarely a feeling you wait for. It is built, slowly, through the small things you do for yourself every day. LNGVTY is that idea in a bottle: a daily habit, kept long enough to become a different way of seeing yourself.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

